NativeWeChatStyle includes the exact locally maintained LangBot StickerHub
chat_style.py, chat_style.yaml, and their existing behavioral tests from:
https://github.com/langbot-app/LangBot
plugins/misc/StickerHub/

The copied files retain their existing behavior without modification. They
include previously authorized local persona/style changes. SOURCE.json records
the local checkout revision and exact source hashes. LangBot is distributed
under Apache License 2.0; see UPSTREAM-LICENSE.txt.

This package adds only a minimal plugin wrapper, manifest, test fixture, and
documentation. It does not include StickerHub tools or image sending.
